<title>PAKISTAN: ICI PAKISTAN FIRST HALF NET FALLS 22 PCT.</title>
<headline>ICI PAKISTAN FIRST HALF NET FALLS 22 PCT.</headline>
<dateline>KARACHI, Pakistan 1997-08-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Half year ended June 30, 1997 (in million rupees)</p>
<p>    Turnover		3,063 vs 3,268</p>
<p>    Pre-tax profit	  263 vs   341</p>
<p>    After-tax profit	164 vs   209</p>
<p>    Interim dividend	nil vs  17.5 pct on 10-rupee share</p>
<p>NOTE - ICI Pakistan Ltd is a subsidiary of Imperial Chemical Industries Plc. It manufactures polyester, soda ash, paints, pharmaceuticals and agrochemicals. No dividend was announced so there is no book closure.</p>
<p>-- Ibrahim Khan (9221) 5685192; Fax (9221) 5673428</p>
